    description: "From the WI-kosup knob census (2026-10-28; /home/jgstern_agent/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/kosup_reader_census_10282026/C_knobs.md K3-K6, K17-K21). Remaining knob gaps:\n- Taint loaders after WI-rinaz: a misspelled LANGUAGE key and a string (non-mapping) row are dropped silently; a user sink file's unreached: is accepted but only the shipped-directory reader reads it; a string row in transforms: raises a raw AttributeError that reaches main's catch-all and exits rc 1 -- the code verify-claims uses for 'violated' (code reading, not run end to end).\n- claims files: taint_flow.allowed_sanitizers is allowlisted and stored, never read.\n- function summaries: the consumer checks fields for truthiness only; which parameters flow, sanitize from/to labels and callback details are never read; infer_summary has no production caller.\n- config dataclasses never constructed / read: SupplyChainConfig (WI-jaloz), BUILTIN_ATTRIBUTE_EXCEPTIONS validator runs only in tests and .prefer is read nowhere, tracker AuthConfig, CompactConfig.min_per_language (read only on a branch production never takes).\n- CLI/env: routes -x is a deprecated no-op; HG_MEMORY_DEBUG is undocumented; five env vars documented elsewhere are missing from the spec's env table; a non-integer HYPERGUMBO_MIN_MEMORY_MB crashes at import; survey --budgets 4k,banana silently drops the invalid spec.\nNot inventoried: cfg_nodes / url_folding loaders, the trust-store JSON, runtime_coherence --allowlist, tracker config.yaml keys."  # bf9f
